3. Structural Integrity Clause
Derivative specifications must clearly document modifications. Misrepresentation of authorship or origin of the LBH protocol is prohibited.

4. Ethical Use Declaration
This specification may not be used for:
- Intentional harm to civilian populations.
- Surveillance systems designed to violate fundamental human rights.
- Covert weaponized autonomous systems.

5. Sovereignty Principle
The LBH protocol is designed for distributed edge sovereignty. Implementations must not falsely claim centralized ownership of the protocol itself.

The name “MESENTERY” represents the structural connective philosophy: A living system that connects, nourishes, and sustains without domination.

